Z||000002||Pontiaddict||08-05-2000||09:09 PM||||If you have a tube running from the valve cover, to the firewall, then to the air inlet  then it's pre recall. If it runs from the valve cover to the air inlet it's after recall.<P>That's if I'm talking about the right thing.||||reg||1
